			"notes": "![AnimatedLogo](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/4446cf8c0e1b1f12adfbe9ca62d302cd4d6558fb.png)\n\n---\n\n# 🎉 Animated Logo v1.4 Update!\n\nA new update for **Animated Logo** is here, introducing **v1.4**! 🚀\n\n## ✨ What’s New\n\n* ✅ **More Versions Supported**\n  Expanded compatibility so more players can use the mod across additional Minecraft versions.\n\n* 🛠️ **Bug Fixes**\n\n  * Fixed an issue where the **animation and sound wouldn’t play while idle**. Animations should now run consistently as intended.\n\n---\n\nUpdate to **v1.4** and enjoy the improvements more updates coming soon 👀"
